---
description: Zero hardcoded magic strings, numbers, or hex colors in React Native components.
globs: src/screens/**/*.tsx,src/components/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Hardcoded Values Rule

## 1. Strings
Never put raw user-facing strings directly in JSX:
- ❌ `<Text>Player Roster</Text>`
- ✅ `<Text>{STRINGS.ROSTER.TITLE}</Text>`

## 2. Colors
Never use inline hex codes, RGB strings, or raw color names:
- ❌ `color: '#1E293B'`, `backgroundColor: 'red'`
- ✅ `color: COLORS.TEXT_PRIMARY`, `backgroundColor: COLORS.DANGER`

## 3. Spacing & Sizes
Never use raw numbers for margins, paddings, gaps, font sizes, or border radii:
- ❌ `padding: 12`, `fontSize: 16`, `gap: 8`, `borderRadius: 10`
- ✅ `padding: Spacing.md`, `fontSize: FontSize.md`, `gap: Spacing.sm`, `borderRadius: Shape.card`
